      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a really solid start. The tone is definitely leaning into that luxury feel, and you've woven the keywords in naturally without it feeling forced. \n\nHowever, I just ran that through the client's tool and the score was actually pretty low—it's barely hitting the threshold they want for their SEO rankings. They're really banking on this high score to drive traffic.\n\nCan you do another version? Try to push that keyword density up a bit more so the score is higher. Just please, please don't make it look like a list of words or anything. It still has to read like a high-end, flowing description for a luxury brand. I just need more of those specific keywords integrated into the prose.",
